@startuml 6_3_FireShot_CommunicationDiagram
frame "sd FireShot" {
  actor "Cian\n(current turn)" as Player
  rectangle "ui : UIManager" as UI
  rectangle "oppUI : UIManager" as OppUI
  actor "timer : Timer" as Timer
  rectangle "server : Server" as Server
  rectangle "repo : GameRepository" as Repo
  rectangle "net : NetworkHandler" as Net
  rectangle "game : Game" as Game
  rectangle "oppBoard : Board" as Board
  rectangle "cell : Cell" as Cell
  rectangle "ship : Ship" as Ship
  rectangle "shot : Shot" as Shot
  Player -down- UI : ↓ 1 : onCellClick(H8)\n⇡ 1.1 [cell.isAlreadyShot()] : no highlight, click ignored (UC3 2a)\n⇡ 1.3 : hit / miss / &#34;You sunk their Destroyer&#34;
  UI -down- Net : ⇡ 1.2.2.5.1 [saved] : onBroadcast(update), then onState(getMyState)
  OppUI -down- Net : ⇡ 1.2.2.5.2 [saved] : onBroadcast(update), then onState(getMyState)
  UI -down- Server : ↓ 1.2 : fireShot(code, H8)\n⇡ 1.2.3 [stale] : STALE\n⇡ 1.2.4 [saved] : shot
  Server -- Server : 1.2.1 : seatedCaller(code)\n1.2.2.2.1 : fireIfTurnExpired(game)
  Server -down- Repo : ↓ 1.2.2 : runShotTransaction(code, shooter, H8, beforeShot)\n↑ 1.2.2.2 : beforeShot(game)\n⇡ 1.2.2.6 [another save landed first] : StaleGameError\n⇡ 1.2.2.7 [saved] : shot\n↓ 2.1 : loadGame(), p.disconnect(), saveGame()\n↓ 3.1 : loadGame(code)\n↓ 3.4 [expired] : saveGame(game, version)
  Repo -- Repo : 1.2.2.1 : loadGame(code) : game, version\n1.2.2.4 : saveGame(game, version) via save_game()
  Net -down- Repo : ↑ 1.2.2.5 [saved] : game_updated (database trigger on games)
  Net -down- Server : ↓ 2 [current player loses presence] : reportDisconnect(code)
  Timer -down- Server : ↓ 3 [countdown ends, nobody acted] : claimTimeout(code)\n⇡ 3.5 : true, or false (try again)
  Server -down- Game : ↓ 1.2.2.2.2 [isTurnExpired() and player to move connected] : fireRandomShot(currentTurn)\n↓ 3.2 : isTurnExpired()\n↓ 3.3 [expired and player to move connected] : fireRandomShot(currentTurn)
  Repo -down- Game : ↓ 1.2.2.3 : fireShot(shooter, H8)\n⇡ 1.2.2.3.6 : shot
  Game -- Game : 1.2.2.3.2 : turnStartedAt = now\n1.2.2.3.3 [shot.isHit() and not oppBoard.allShipsSunk()] : currentTurn unchanged\n1.2.2.3.4 [shot.result == MISS and doubleShotActive] : doubleShotActive = false\n1.2.2.3.5 [shot.result == MISS and not doubleShotActive] : switchTurn()
  Game -down- Board : ↓ 1.2.2.3.1 : receiveShot(H8, shooter)\n⇡ 1.2.2.3.1.9 : shot
  Board -down- Cell : ↓ 1.2.2.3.1.1 : isAlreadyShot()\n⇡ 1.2.2.3.1.1.1 : false\n↓ 1.2.2.3.1.2 [a Ship occupies H8] : markHit()\n↓ 1.2.2.3.1.7 [no Ship at H8] : markMiss()
  Board -down- Ship : ↓ 1.2.2.3.1.3 [a Ship occupies H8] : registerHit()\n↓ 1.2.2.3.1.4 [a Ship occupies H8] : isSunk()\n⇡ 1.2.2.3.1.4.1 : sunk
  Board -down- Shot : ↓ 1.2.2.3.1.5 [a Ship occupies H8 and sunk] : <<create>> Shot(H8, SUNK, shooter, sunkShipName)\n↓ 1.2.2.3.1.6 [a Ship occupies H8 and ship still afloat] : <<create>> Shot(H8, HIT, shooter)\n↓ 1.2.2.3.1.8 [no Ship at H8] : <<create>> Shot(H8, MISS, shooter)
}
legend bottom
  1.2.2.2: a turn that ran out gets its random shot first, saved even if H8 is then refused.
  2: the turn timer pauses while the player to move is away; back within 60 s,
  getMyState() calls resumeTurnTimer(awayMs), otherwise claimTimeout() awards the win (6.2).
endlegend
@enduml
